  "reason": "Fixture authoring correction before production evaluation: styles require one property per physical line and multiline blocks. Same-purpose legal source uses multiline styles; geometry oracle unchanged. Not a product defect or accepted extension.",
  "source": "nui 1\nstyle Ink { width: 2px, color: #123456, }\nstyle Red { width: 2px, color: #aa5612, }\nprofile Draft\nprofile Cut\nstyle Detail {\n width: 2px, color: #123456,\n for @Cut { visible: false, }\n}\ngroup Piece {\n point Origin = coordinate(x: 3, y: -5)\n for i in range(min: 0, max: 0, step: 1) {\n  line Mark [Ink] = segment(start: (11 + 17 * @i, 5 + 13 * @i), end: (14 + 17 * @i, 9 + 13 * @i))\n }\n}\ngroup Control {\n point Ignored = coordinate(x: -1000, y: -2000)\n line Calibration [Ink] = segment(start: (-107, -31), end: (-7, -31))\n line Sibling [Red] = segment(start: (2, -11), end: (5, -7))\n}\ngroup Unselected {\n line Outside [Ink] = segment(start: (5000, 5000), end: (5100, 5000))\n}\nlayout Pattern {\n place @Piece(at: (0, 0), scale: 1, angle: 0, mirror: false)\n place @Control(at: (0, 0), scale: 1, angle: 0, mirror: false)\n}\nsvg Vector(layout: @Pattern, profile: @Draft, margin: 3)\nprint Paper(layout: @Pattern, profile: @Draft, paper: a4, orientation: portrait, overlap: 10)\n",
